<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>fixed star<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'étoile fixe<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 fixed star</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/fɪkst stɑ:/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/etwal fiks/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('fixed star', 'l\'étoile fixe')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 恒星</td><td class='def-en'>any star in the Ptolemaic theory of planetary motion</td><td>3.2</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_16' data-word="fixed star" src='images/fixed_star.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('fixed star', 'astronomy', 'img_16')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
