<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>major planet<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la planète<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 major planet</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈmeidʒə ˈplænit/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/planɛt/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('major planet', 'la planète')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>大行星</td><td class='def-en'>(astronomy) any of the nine large celestial bodies in the solar system that revolve around the sun and shine by reflected light; Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune, and Pluto in order of their proximity to the sun; viewed from the constellation Hercules, all the planets rotate around the sun in a counterclockwise direction</td><td>3.2</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_18' data-word="major planet" src='images/major_planet.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('major planet', 'astronomy', 'img_18')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
